    "误删了？去 照片 → 相簿 → 最近删除 恢复。未清空时，30 天内可以找回。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "误删了？去 照片 → 相簿 → 最近删除 恢复。未清空时，30 天内可以找回。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deleted by mistake? Open Photos → Albums → Recently Deleted to recover. Items are recoverable for 30 days unless you empty that album."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "誤刪了？前往 照片 → 相簿 → 最近刪除 復原。尚未清空時，30 天內可以找回。"
          }
        }
